WEBVTT

00:00:02.109 --> 00:00:05.279
Once, when many planets
intermingled and

00:00:05.613 --> 00:00:08.716
the boundary between man
and god was vague...

00:00:09.316 --> 00:00:14.221
There was a tale of a particular family.
A tale of love and rebirth.

00:00:17.892 --> 00:00:27.167
Sometimes I think things over.
It helps to cheer me up.

00:00:34.942 --> 00:00:37.678
K'Yy O U S O UG I G A

00:00:40.848 --> 00:00:44.552
This place has always
meant everything to me.

00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:49.857
It rains so beautifully here.

00:00:50.190 --> 00:00:55.296
I can dance like the wind.

00:00:57.798 --> 00:01:00.801
Even now, I'm having fun.

00:01:03.270 --> 00:01:06.640
I have a better sense of
rhythm than you'd think.

00:01:07.141 --> 00:01:12.313
It felt as though every time
I heard a certain someone's voice,

00:01:12.780 --> 00:01:22.723
I would think back to how
I grew up surrounded by laughter.

00:01:23.090 --> 00:01:28.762
Yes, anywhere would have
done as a place to call home.

00:01:28.762 --> 00:01:34.301
Farewell, sunshine!
The night rises up invitingly.

00:01:34.501 --> 00:01:39.573
It's okay, this world moves
in a way that will connect us.

00:01:39.807 --> 00:01:46.280
So that we can all smile
together once again.

00:01:53.554 --> 00:01:55.823
We haven't learned a thing...

00:01:57.992 --> 00:01:59.126
Have we?

00:02:02.429 --> 00:02:03.530
Oh well.

00:02:05.866 --> 00:02:10.371
Troublesome Talks Here and There

00:02:10.371 --> 00:02:11.839
Chapter 22: Present
(16)/ Collapse

00:02:31.659 --> 00:02:32.726
What's going on?

00:02:33.260 --> 00:02:35.496
Hey, what is this?

00:02:39.400 --> 00:02:41.001
Explain!

00:02:41.001 --> 00:02:42.936
You're the priest, right?

00:02:44.338 --> 00:02:45.139
Myoue.

00:02:46.907 --> 00:02:49.810
| did this.

00:02:50.844 --> 00:02:54.181
This happened because I jumped in
with Aratama and interfered.

00:02:55.115 --> 00:02:57.384
Right, Sensei?

00:03:07.594 --> 00:03:08.095
Hey.

00:03:09.296 --> 00:03:10.197
Dear!

00:03:22.076 --> 00:03:22.843
My!

00:03:55.743 --> 00:03:58.479
North Ooji is destroyed.

00:03:58.779 --> 00:04:00.080
| can't respond fast enough.

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:01.582
I'll do it.

00:04:01.882 --> 00:04:03.317
#12! #13!

00:04:15.162 --> 00:04:16.930
What's going on?!

00:04:30.811 --> 00:04:31.445
Hey!

00:04:32.012 --> 00:04:32.713
Are you okay?

00:04:34.348 --> 00:04:37.184
My grandmother is gone.

00:04:38.952 --> 00:04:39.920
And the shrine...

00:04:41.522 --> 00:04:44.324
Did you lose something, too?

00:04:44.958 --> 00:04:47.895
Why are you talking like that?

00:05:05.679 --> 00:05:06.513
Sis...

00:05:06.980 --> 00:05:08.882
It's okay, Koto.

00:05:09.183 --> 00:05:11.351
What do you mean, "it's okay"?

00:05:11.351 --> 00:05:13.720
There's been massive damage, Koto!

00:05:13.954 --> 00:05:15.088
What?

00:05:15.088 --> 00:05:16.657
It's not Koto's fault.

00:05:16.924 --> 00:05:18.325
Then whose fault is it?

00:05:18.892 --> 00:05:21.161
It's all Koto's fault! All of it!

00:05:21.361 --> 00:05:22.362
Shut up!

00:05:22.596 --> 00:05:24.364
Don't blame her for everything!

00:05:24.832 --> 00:05:26.033
Yeah! Yeah!

00:05:26.033 --> 00:05:27.868
You wanna fight, kid?

00:05:27.868 --> 00:05:29.169
You'll regret it!

00:05:35.075 --> 00:05:35.909
Miss Girlfriend!

00:05:37.077 --> 00:05:37.878
Koto...

00:05:38.712 --> 00:05:39.813
I'm glad...

00:05:41.481 --> 00:05:42.816
What? What?

00:05:43.617 --> 00:05:44.651
Are you hurt?

00:05:45.485 --> 00:05:46.553
I'm fine.

00:05:46.553 --> 00:05:47.888
It's nothing.

00:05:48.355 --> 00:05:49.790
It'll get better.

00:05:54.928 --> 00:05:56.563
What about you? Are you okay?

00:05:59.867 --> 00:06:00.834
I'm sorry.

00:06:01.435 --> 00:06:02.035
Koto?

00:06:02.636 --> 00:06:05.405
<i>I'm sorry. I'm sorry. 'm sorry.</i>

00:06:05.772 --> 00:06:06.340
Koto?

00:06:08.976 --> 00:06:10.177
I'm really sorry.

00:06:15.782 --> 00:06:18.118
Why didn't you tell her anything?

00:06:20.220 --> 00:06:23.290
When I gave her to you,
| told you, didn't 1?

00:06:23.757 --> 00:06:25.359
| told you to take care of her!

00:06:27.060 --> 00:06:28.428
She's not the only one.

00:06:28.662 --> 00:06:29.930
You didn't tell me, either...

00:06:31.798 --> 00:06:35.669
Why do you always just stand
there and never say anything?

00:06:38.939 --> 00:06:41.441
You knew the dream would change.

00:06:42.075 --> 00:06:43.543
Don't get so mad.

00:06:45.045 --> 00:06:46.680
After all this has happened...

00:06:50.250 --> 00:06:51.551
After all this...

00:06:51.952 --> 00:06:53.987
How can I not be mad?

00:06:54.554 --> 00:06:55.722
But...

00:06:56.924 --> 00:06:58.525
No buts!

00:06:59.459 --> 00:07:01.295
I'm sorry.

00:07:01.962 --> 00:07:03.964
Stop acting like that!

00:07:05.666 --> 00:07:06.867
Jeez...

00:07:07.701 --> 00:07:11.972
You're certainly not acting like you
haven't seen each other in centuries.

00:07:13.206 --> 00:07:14.241
That form...

00:07:16.543 --> 00:07:17.344
Father.

00:07:18.178 --> 00:07:20.814
We are no longer children.

00:07:21.248 --> 00:07:24.184
Isn't it about time you
told us what's going on?

00:07:25.018 --> 00:07:26.219
Why this happened,

00:07:26.219 --> 00:07:27.721
why you left,

00:07:27.988 --> 00:07:29.423
and who Koto is?

00:07:34.528 --> 00:07:35.362
Sir!

00:07:36.496 --> 00:07:37.965
Um...

00:07:38.899 --> 00:07:42.536
Yase Douiji is in front of
the station right now...

00:07:42.970 --> 00:07:45.505
Wow! How fun!

00:07:45.739 --> 00:07:47.107
| can see people!

00:07:47.708 --> 00:07:48.809
Oh, my! Yase!

00:07:50.210 --> 00:07:52.045
What are you doing there?

00:07:52.279 --> 00:07:54.314
Oh, hello.

00:07:56.283 --> 00:07:57.784
Who are you?

00:07:59.019 --> 00:08:00.787
You're so pretty!

00:08:02.689 --> 00:08:03.357
Yase...

00:08:05.158 --> 00:08:07.627
It's already working on their memories?

00:08:08.161 --> 00:08:09.963
That's my girl!

00:08:24.978 --> 00:08:25.579
Koto.

00:08:30.751 --> 00:08:35.322
Our daughter is so...
wonderfully special.

00:08:39.092 --> 00:08:40.727
You okay, Koto?

00:08:43.463 --> 00:08:44.865
Did you get hurt somewhere?

00:08:48.235 --> 00:08:50.337
Really, what's the matter, Koto?

00:09:12.159 --> 00:09:12.859
Sis?

00:09:20.033 --> 00:09:22.135
This is all my fault.

00:09:23.904 --> 00:09:25.238
For now, I'll give you this.

00:09:26.239 --> 00:09:27.307
What do you mean?

00:09:28.675 --> 00:09:30.877
I'm sorry I hurt you.

00:09:34.147 --> 00:09:34.915
It's okay.

00:09:35.315 --> 00:09:36.716
I'll do something about this.

00:09:37.517 --> 00:09:40.720
| will! No matter what!

00:09:48.728 --> 00:09:50.230
We've been waiting for this!

00:09:50.397 --> 00:09:51.731
Here it is!

00:09:54.367 --> 00:09:55.335
What is this?

00:09:59.439 --> 00:10:01.174
Oh, my!

00:10:01.441 --> 00:10:02.676
There they are.

00:10:13.520 --> 00:10:14.488
The Shrine?

00:10:15.021 --> 00:10:17.023
Ky OuUSsS O UGI G A

00:10:17.023 --> 00:10:18.492
Chapter 23: The
Present (17)/ The Shrine

00:10:19.359 --> 00:10:20.727
What's the Shrine doing here?

00:10:20.927 --> 00:10:23.630
We've got unwelcome guests!

00:10:23.630 --> 00:10:25.932
Uh oh, they've found out
about your paradise!

00:10:26.066 --> 00:10:27.400
What do you mean?

00:10:27.400 --> 00:10:28.869
What do we mean?

00:10:28.869 --> 00:10:30.103
Exactly what we said!

00:10:30.337 --> 00:10:32.639
Inari kept it a secret this whole time!

00:10:32.639 --> 00:10:34.841
The paradise they dream of.

00:10:35.108 --> 00:10:37.644
They want to go!
They can't go! Oh, well!

00:10:37.644 --> 00:10:39.813
But it's tough to keep
secrets from the Shrine!

00:10:40.180 --> 00:10:42.782
And once they find out,
that's it for the land of dreams!

00:10:43.150 --> 00:10:43.817
What?

00:10:44.284 --> 00:10:45.886
What are you trying to say?

00:10:46.286 --> 00:10:47.454
Koto...

00:10:47.787 --> 00:10:49.689
You're special!

00:10:49.956 --> 00:10:51.791
A special little girl!

00:10:51.992 --> 00:10:53.960
You were born between
a god and a buddha!

00:10:54.094 --> 00:10:56.830
That makes you super syncretic!

00:11:00.667 --> 00:11:02.169
What's the High Priest doing here?

00:11:02.169 --> 00:11:04.504
You don't know, do you, little girl?

00:11:04.671 --> 00:11:07.040
The world you see in
the mirror is imaginary:

00:11:07.240 --> 00:11:10.677
The 13th plane,
the one that shouldn't exist.

00:11:10.911 --> 00:11:12.312
The 13th plane?

00:11:24.724 --> 00:11:26.526
You're early.

00:11:29.129 --> 00:11:31.831
How many years has it been
since we've met in person?

00:11:32.732 --> 00:11:35.168
It's been a long time.

00:11:35.569 --> 00:11:40.674
This wasn't how I'd hoped
for us to reunite,

00:11:41.775 --> 00:11:45.845
but even we have difficulties
preventing unexpected accidents.

00:11:47.781 --> 00:11:50.016
This is a nice place, Inari.

00:11:51.318 --> 00:11:54.921
| understand why you'd want to hide it.

00:11:55.589 --> 00:11:57.090
Right?

00:11:58.391 --> 00:12:02.729
I'd appreciate it if you'd just pretend
you never found out about it.

00:12:03.830 --> 00:12:05.031
Unfortunately...

00:12:05.465 --> 00:12:06.166
High Priest!

00:12:07.968 --> 00:12:08.602
Koto!

00:12:09.236 --> 00:12:11.137
Why did you come here personally?

00:12:11.538 --> 00:12:14.441
I'm the one who's surprised, Koto.

00:12:15.475 --> 00:12:18.778
You vanish on the first
day you join the squad,

00:12:19.279 --> 00:12:21.481
then you suddenly show up
in the sanctuary,

00:12:21.481 --> 00:12:24.451
smash the observation system,
and vanish once again.

00:12:25.785 --> 00:12:29.623
You and your parents are
just so out of control.

00:12:29.623 --> 00:12:31.491
We just can't keep up.

00:12:32.392 --> 00:12:36.463
Well, I did make it here
before the end, thanks to you...

00:12:36.830 --> 00:12:37.964
So I guess it worked out okay.

00:12:38.298 --> 00:12:39.332
Hold it!

00:12:44.671 --> 00:12:46.906
What you just said...

00:12:47.674 --> 00:12:49.476
What do you mean by "the end"?

00:12:54.581 --> 00:12:57.684
Do you know how much Katsura
has been worrying about you?

00:12:58.585 --> 00:12:59.319
High Priest!

00:13:01.588 --> 00:13:04.124
The Looking Glass City
is going to be destroyed.

00:13:05.558 --> 00:13:07.260
That's not good at all!

00:13:09.863 --> 00:13:11.398
There's no way around it.

00:13:11.831 --> 00:13:13.633
Not now.

00:13:21.341 --> 00:13:22.208
No!

00:13:22.876 --> 00:13:25.378
Ichijouji and the others
might know something!

00:13:25.812 --> 00:13:26.880
Please, High Priest!

00:13:27.147 --> 00:13:29.582
| don't want to destroy this place.

00:13:31.651 --> 00:13:35.088
Koto, there's nothing we can do...

00:13:35.355 --> 00:13:39.225
It's the Unified Organization's job to
keep the world safe and stable, right?

00:13:39.626 --> 00:13:41.961
I'm part of your personal squad, too.

00:13:42.796 --> 00:13:46.333
If you won't help me, then I'll
just decide to do it myself!

00:13:46.333 --> 00:13:47.000
Koto.

00:13:48.535 --> 00:13:49.969
You can't do that.

00:13:50.804 --> 00:13:53.039
Precisely because we are
the Unified Organization,

00:13:53.039 --> 00:13:54.674
there are things I can't allow.

00:13:56.710 --> 00:14:00.914
This is a place that should never
have been allowed to exist.

00:14:03.850 --> 00:14:06.286
The 13th plane...

00:14:07.887 --> 00:14:09.055
Where did you hear that?

00:14:11.391 --> 00:14:14.694
If you know,
then that makes this simple.

00:14:15.428 --> 00:14:19.199
This place is a forbidden land,
made through pure force

00:14:19.532 --> 00:14:22.635
by your father when he violated the
rules of the role he was given.

00:14:23.870 --> 00:14:27.874
Do you intend to make me
explain everything?

00:14:29.709 --> 00:14:32.912
Do your job, observer.

00:14:34.681 --> 00:14:35.882
Observer?

00:14:41.688 --> 00:14:42.622
Sensei...

00:14:44.224 --> 00:14:47.527
This place, the Looking Glass City,

00:14:48.728 --> 00:14:50.797
doesn't exist inside a picture.

00:14:53.299 --> 00:14:56.803
It's a plane of existence created
without the Shrine's knowledge.

00:14:58.872 --> 00:15:01.007
| knew I'd be in big
trouble if they found out.

00:15:01.808 --> 00:15:04.511
| used a lot of tricks, but...

00:15:06.246 --> 00:15:10.717
| didn't think you'd go this far, Koto.

00:15:13.219 --> 00:15:14.187
This isn't a place

00:15:14.621 --> 00:15:18.658
where forced intervention is
even supposed to be possible.

00:15:19.392 --> 00:15:20.894
But you did it!

00:15:21.761 --> 00:15:25.932
You opened a hole by force
from your side, didn't you?

00:15:27.867 --> 00:15:32.505
With a giant opening like that,
the rest is simple.

00:15:36.676 --> 00:15:38.344
She's very bold.

00:15:38.978 --> 00:15:41.080
She reminds me of someone.

00:15:43.316 --> 00:15:47.253
But even if it shouldn't
be allowed to exist...

00:15:48.321 --> 00:15:50.423
It already does.

00:15:51.825 --> 00:15:53.359
Can't we just leave it?

00:15:55.395 --> 00:15:56.062
Koto.

00:15:57.297 --> 00:15:59.699
Do you remember what you
just called this place?

00:15:59.699 --> 00:16:02.202
The 13th plane.

00:16:03.603 --> 00:16:08.942
It's connected to the other 12.

00:16:09.876 --> 00:16:10.977
All of them.

00:16:17.350 --> 00:16:20.587
| told you you'd done
something crazy, didn't |?

00:16:20.920 --> 00:16:23.256
It's causing a
chain reaction everywhere!

00:16:24.891 --> 00:16:26.025
No...

00:16:26.793 --> 00:16:27.694
Sis!

00:16:28.361 --> 00:16:29.662
No way...

00:16:30.630 --> 00:16:32.031
Do you understand?

00:16:32.866 --> 00:16:36.703
This is the result of your playing house.

00:16:38.638 --> 00:16:40.707
You forgot the role you were given,

00:16:40.707 --> 00:16:43.610
and messed with the fabric of
reality however you pleased.

00:16:44.644 --> 00:16:49.015
Did you think that was
your task as an observer?

00:16:49.015 --> 00:16:51.017
Ky OuUSsS O UGI G A

00:16:51.017 --> 00:16:52.485
Chapter 24: The
Present (18)/ Koto

00:16:59.259 --> 00:17:02.862
High Priest, I am grateful to you.

00:17:03.963 --> 00:17:05.498
You forgave my mischief,

00:17:06.099 --> 00:17:08.601
and whenever something happened,
you helped me.

00:17:09.736 --> 00:17:11.604
Even in that bothersome Shrine,

00:17:11.905 --> 00:17:14.941
your giving me the role
of the fox mask

00:17:15.375 --> 00:17:17.477
let Koto grow up to be the girl she is.

00:17:21.147 --> 00:17:24.284
But I... understood.

00:17:25.952 --> 00:17:32.892
Our task stretches
beyond eternity, but when...

00:17:35.295 --> 00:17:37.597
When I found even a little bit of light...

00:17:38.498 --> 00:17:43.503
Those who stood by my side
meant more than anything.

00:17:45.038 --> 00:17:49.409
Even if the cost was twisting
the fabric of reality?

00:17:52.412 --> 00:17:55.481
High Priest, even then,
| feel no uncertainty.

00:17:56.549 --> 00:18:01.421
| know what's most important to me.

00:18:02.388 --> 00:18:03.790
Observer...

00:18:04.290 --> 00:18:06.626
Do you honestly think
you've become human?

00:18:08.361 --> 00:18:09.829
Are you saying...

00:18:11.531 --> 00:18:14.334
...it's wrong to want love
if you're not human?

00:18:14.968 --> 00:18:16.469
This is nonsense.

00:18:17.337 --> 00:18:18.304
Sheer stupidity.

00:18:23.376 --> 00:18:24.644
A? Un? What's wrong?

00:18:26.846 --> 00:18:27.647
Sensei!

00:18:28.848 --> 00:18:29.382
Darling!

00:18:40.627 --> 00:18:41.127
Koto!

00:18:41.394 --> 00:18:42.095
Mom!

00:18:42.629 --> 00:18:43.296
Koto...

00:18:43.730 --> 00:18:44.731
I'm fine.

00:18:45.365 --> 00:18:47.500
It's nothing serious.

00:18:50.770 --> 00:18:52.271
Yes, it is!

00:18:59.278 --> 00:19:00.546
What is this?

00:19:00.813 --> 00:19:01.581
Oh, my!

00:19:02.382 --> 00:19:03.916
Fireworks in the daytime?

00:19:06.719 --> 00:19:11.357
Your mother lost the power she once had
when she gave birth to you.

00:19:12.558 --> 00:19:16.129
It seems you inherited it all.

00:19:18.064 --> 00:19:19.632
Her existence is so weak now,

00:19:19.632 --> 00:19:24.203
she shouldn't be able to exist
outside the sanctuary.

00:19:25.405 --> 00:19:27.940
No good will come of making
her strain herself.

00:19:29.142 --> 00:19:31.544
Especially now.

00:19:34.380 --> 00:19:35.615
It's my fault.

00:19:37.116 --> 00:19:41.621
My mom was stuck there
because I was born.

00:19:43.890 --> 00:19:46.159
It's my fault...

00:19:48.561 --> 00:19:52.732
To think this was the result of
your gallant search for a home.

00:19:54.000 --> 00:19:55.201
How ironic.

00:20:05.244 --> 00:20:07.547
No, Koto.

00:20:08.514 --> 00:20:11.217
That's not true, Koto.

00:20:12.652 --> 00:20:17.156
You don't know how happy we
were when you were born...

00:20:17.924 --> 00:20:18.591
Koto!

00:20:39.712 --> 00:20:42.148
It's all my fault...

00:20:42.615 --> 00:20:43.916
No, Koto!

00:20:44.383 --> 00:20:45.451
Look over here!

00:20:50.223 --> 00:20:51.290
Koto!

00:20:56.496 --> 00:20:57.497
My fault...

00:21:01.234 --> 00:21:01.834
Koto!

00:21:12.478 --> 00:21:13.146
My!

00:21:15.414 --> 00:21:16.215
Koto...

00:21:22.855 --> 00:21:24.557
What the hell are you doing?

00:21:26.392 --> 00:21:29.595
It should take more than this
to knock you off your feet.

00:21:31.430 --> 00:21:31.998
Hey.

00:21:38.504 --> 00:21:43.309
Your parents are alive,
and they're right over there!

00:21:44.777 --> 00:21:47.313
My real parents and my real siblings...

00:21:48.481 --> 00:21:50.883
They all died a long time ago!

00:21:53.219 --> 00:21:55.421
Your parents are alive!

00:21:56.589 --> 00:22:00.993
Stop standing there sulking, and do
what you can while they're alive!

00:22:18.344 --> 00:22:20.112
You awake now?

00:22:23.683 --> 00:22:24.150
Yup!

00:22:26.519 --> 00:22:29.989
Remember, I've got something
else I need you to do.

00:22:30.790 --> 00:22:33.559
So I can't have you die here.

00:22:33.960 --> 00:22:35.628
Yeah. You're right.

00:22:37.463 --> 00:22:38.564
You're right.

00:22:39.165 --> 00:22:40.633
I'll help you.

00:22:41.100 --> 00:22:43.202
So get that old man to
see things your way!

00:22:45.037 --> 00:22:45.538
Yeah.

00:22:49.876 --> 00:22:54.180
Try harder this time. You weren't
a bit of help with Mom, after all...

00:22:54.180 --> 00:22:55.715
| suppose not...

00:23:00.286 --> 00:23:01.020
High Priest!

00:23:08.060 --> 00:23:09.161
I've made up my mind.

00:23:09.829 --> 00:23:12.198
If you don't help me save my mom,

00:23:12.565 --> 00:23:16.435
and everybody in the Looking Glass City,
I'll destroy all the planes!

00:23:18.471 --> 00:23:20.006
I'm not sure that's...

00:23:24.277 --> 00:23:25.244
My.

00:23:25.578 --> 00:23:28.247
All this will have been
pointless if I let it end here!

00:23:29.081 --> 00:23:31.851
So if there's no point,
I'd rather just end everything.

00:23:35.988 --> 00:23:38.557
So what's it gonna be, Shrine?

00:23:47.199 --> 00:23:53.606
I'd even cut things off, (Ouch!)
to prove the fact I exist.

00:23:55.441 --> 00:24:01.547
Though eternal lies surround me,
they're my safety line.

00:24:03.349 --> 00:24:09.956
"Wanna take you high?"
The galaxy shakes. You smile.

00:24:11.524 --> 00:24:17.997
I want to touch you. I don't want
to hear that it's forbidden.

00:24:19.799 --> 00:24:23.469
Moved to emotion by arguments,
| cast aside reason.

00:24:23.469 --> 00:24:28.574
I enter a game of risk that's
devoid of reason.

00:24:31.844 --> 00:24:36.615
It's resplendent with rare pain.

00:24:40.052 --> 00:24:45.124
Mistaking the real for the unreal.

00:24:48.260 --> 00:24:52.131
It transcends all understanding.

00:24:52.131 --> 00:24:53.099
So, fight!

00:24:56.369 --> 00:24:57.236
So, fight!

00:25:00.473 --> 00:25:01.307
So, fight!

00:25:08.581 --> 00:25:09.482
So, fight!

00:25:09.982 --> 00:25:11.951
K'Yy O U S O UG I G A

00:25:12.585 --> 00:25:15.454
Koto, you've really grown up.

00:25:15.755 --> 00:25:19.225
You're my wonderfully special daughter,
and I love you very much.

00:25:19.959 --> 00:25:24.130
To me, your birth was a
little bit of an accident,

00:25:24.530 --> 00:25:26.432
though I bet you didn't know that.

00:25:27.166 --> 00:25:29.735
I'll entrust my wish to you!

